  "status": "Approved",
  "description": "Installation of emergency light fitting to Caretakers Entrance ",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this consent.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of Section 18(a) of the Planning (Listed Buildings and Conservation Areas) Act 1990 as amended.\r\n</p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;Prior to installation, details of the emergency light hereby approved shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The details shall include:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;a) the specification of the light fitting, including size, finish and illumination levels (lumens); and&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;b) details of its operation, including whether it is permanently illuminated, emergency-only, or sensor-activated.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The light shall be installed strictly in accordance with the approved details and thereafter retained as such.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Reason: To ensure that the installation is operated in a manner that preserves the special architectural and historic interest of the listed building and avoids unnecessary visual intrusion, in accordance with the Planning (Listed Buildings and Conservation Areas) Act 1990 and the National Planning Policy Framework.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
